---

---

<section id="about" class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-content fade-in">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2 class="section-title">
          About Me
          <svg class="wavy-underline" viewBox="0 0 120 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <path d="M2 6 Q15 2 30 6 T60 6 T90 6 T118 6" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
          </svg>
        </h2>
        <p class="about-intro">
          The short version: I help teams figure out what to build and why,
          then make sure it actually gets built and people love using it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Since 2019, I've been in product management at ScreenCloud, where I've learned
          that the best features come from obsessive customer conversations. I've led 15+
          major product launches and helped grow our customer base from 500 to 10,000+
          accounts. Roadmaps should be living documents, not PowerPoint graveyards.
        </p>
        <p>
          When I'm not debating prioritisation frameworks or digging through
          analytics, you'll find me at a gig, convincing myself I could totally
          learn that guitar riff, or being bossed around by my two cats.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-skills">
        <h3>The Toolkit</h3>
        <ul class="skills-list pick-bullet">
          <li>Product Strategy & Roadmapping</li>
          <li>User Research & Customer Discovery</li>
          <li>Agile & Lean Methodologies</li>
          <li>Data Analysis & Metrics</li>
          <li>Stakeholder Management</li>
          <li>Go-to-Market Planning</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-text p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-intro {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  }

  .about-skills {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .about-skills h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about-skills h3::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .skills-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .skills-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .skills-list li:hover {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-intro {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
